-- ============================================================
-- AQ Companies Portal - Supabase cloud state bootstrap
-- Run ONCE in: Supabase Dashboard -> SQL Editor -> New query -> Run
-- Creates the sync tables and seeds them with the exported
-- data from the local backend.
